# Repository-wide ignores.
#
# Secrets rules come from CLAUDE.md ("Security rules"): .env, .env.*, and
# credential files stay ignored, always. .env.example is the one deliberate
# exception — it carries placeholders only and is meant to be committed.

# Environment and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
.netrc
.pgpass
credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account*.json

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs and local scratch
*.log
npm-debug.log*
nohup.out

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
